# Copy to streams.conf, or use Camera Settings in the app's right-click menu.
#
# One feed per line:
#
#     Name = URL
#
# The name is whatever you want to call the camera; it appears in the
# right-click menu. Order decides the hotkey: the first line is 1, the ninth is
# 9, the tenth is 0. Ten feeds maximum. Anything after that is ignored.
#
# To find the URLs in Protect: click the camera -> Settings -> Share Livestream
# -> enable Secure RTSPS Output. A link then appears under each resolution.
# Paste them exactly as shown; they work as-is, with no need to rewrite them to
# port 7447. See the README.
#
# A camera's quality tiers are separate streams, so you can mix cameras and
# qualities however you like:

Front Door = rtsps://192.168.0.1:7441/REPLACE_WITH_STREAM_ID?enableSrtp
Driveway   = rtsps://192.168.0.1:7441/REPLACE_WITH_STREAM_ID?enableSrtp
